{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794180704,"nonce":"883W9mLe++dzDyf4YsZYzAwL9qA=","title":"L3 — Animated sidebar toggle and Light/Dark/System theme","message":"## Context\nThe sidebar toggle `icon_pill(lu::panel_left(), Message::Noop)` (`src/ui/screen.rs:79`) does nothing. The sidebar is a fixed `width(276)` (`screen.rs:199`). The theme is a light/dark bool (`src/workspace.rs:51`, `src/app.rs:512`), so the app can't follow the OS.\n\n## Files\n- `src/workspace.rs:47-62` — `Workspace`\n- `src/theme/mod.rs:6-39` — `Mode`\n- `src/app.rs:345,388,512,1343` — boot, `from_parts`, `ToggleTheme`, `subscription`\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:72-122,167-201` — `top_bar`, `sidebar`\n\n## Approach\n- `Workspace`: replace `dark: bool` with `theme: ThemePref { System, Light, Dark }`, defaulting to `System`, plus `sidebar_collapsed: bool`. Keep reading old configs: a legacy `\"dark\": true` maps to `Dark` (a serde alias or a custom default works).\n- App keeps `pref: ThemePref` and `system: iced::theme::Mode`. Boot runs `iced::system::theme()` (`iced_runtime-0.14.0/src/system.rs:58`); `subscription` adds `iced::system::theme_changes()` (`system.rs:63`). The effective `Mode` is `pref`, or `system` when `pref` is `System`. `GBTRACKER_THEME` still overrides.\n- The theme button cycles System → Light → Dark, with icons `lu::monitor()` / `lu::sun()` / `lu::moon()`; the choice is saved through `persist_workspace` (`app.rs:1293`)\n- Sidebar: `ToggleSidebar` animates between 276px and a 64px icon-only rail using `iced::animation::Animation\u003cbool\u003e` (`iced_core-0.14.0/src/animation.rs`) with `.quick()` easing. While it is animating, `subscription` adds `iced::window::frames()`. Labels and the workspace header fade out, using the interpolated value as text alpha. The collapsed rail shows icons only, and the active one keeps the L2 marker.\n- Update the tests at `src/app.rs:1626` and `src/app.rs:1633` to the new pref\n\n## Depends on\nL2 — the selected-state styles used by the rail\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- A fresh config defaults to System; switching the OS appearance while the app runs switches the app with no restart\n- An existing `{\"dark\": true}` config still opens in Dark (unit test in `src/workspace.rs`)\n- The sidebar button animates collapse and expand, and the state survives a restart (unit test that the workspace round-trips `sidebar_collapsed`)\n- No frames subscription while nothing is animating (unit test on `subscription` inputs, or a `needs_frames()` helper)\n- Gates pass","files":null}]}